Z||000001||GT Bastard||10-17-2000||05:34 PM||||First, get some STICKY tires. I dump the clutch at 1600rpm and keep it to the floor.  1FST2M6 recommended this launch(previous owner) and it works well. On warm pavement, it only burns them a couple feet.  On cold pavement I need to baby the throttle a bit for good traction. ||||reg||1
